WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:05.200
Skye, look! The water is glowing!

00:09.450 --> 00:10.550
Mila!

00:33.950 --> 00:36.050
Where... am I?

00:43.300 --> 00:46.550
My friend. Yellow jacket. Where is she?

00:46.950 --> 00:52.850
She is safe. Visitors cannot enter this wing. Unregistered visitors are held,

00:52.900 --> 00:55.350
and their memory of this place is sealed.

01:08.050 --> 01:09.100
She is with me.

01:09.900 --> 01:11.100
My future bride.
